#-------------
STALLIA
#-------------
Biomes 		       - N/A
Spawn Conditions - Spawns around Trail Ruins (structure)
Tag		           - Utility
#-------------
SUN	 	 - 3
HP 		 - 20
#-------------
Additional Notes - Gives zombies in a 5x5 area butter effect (stunned)
for 5 seconds, then slowness I and weakness I for another 5 seconds.
Generally meant to be a basic debuffer / stunner like Ice Shroom.
Feel free to adjust numbers to make it better / worse than Ice Shroom.
There should be purple particles when it is used (reuse Dragon Breath).
